            "title": "Rare earth stocks climb, Bloom Energy deal, Fastenal earnings",
            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance anchor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> examines three of the top trending tickers on Yahoo Finance's platform, including rare earth stocks \u2014 like MP Materials (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MP\">MP</a>), USA Rare Earth (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/USAR\">USAR</a>), and Ramaco Resources (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/METC\">METC</a>) \u2014 climbing, Bloom Energy's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BE\">BE</a>) Brookfield deal, and Fastenal (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/FAST\">FAST</a>) stock falling on the company's earnings miss.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
